<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  « Ranger mes livres » (features 0010 and 0032) and the bilan after a scan. French values of
  ReCIT_iOS/Localizable.xcstrings (manual_sort.*, onboarding.tally.*), keys with '.' turned into '_'
  under a sort_ prefix. iOS's « %#@shelves@ : %2$@. » substitutions are plurals carrying both
  arguments. French needs `many` beside `one` and `other`; it reads as `other`.
  The menu « Ranger dans… » and the sort tag's detail are Android's own: there is no proposal here.
-->
